OL,3,GNEWSARacial vandalism posts show 'best
OL,4,Aand worst of society'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media commentary after an
OL,7,FIslamic community centre was targeted
OL,8,Fby vandals had showed the "best and
OL,9,Fworst of society", a police officer has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FDevon and Cornwall Police previously
OL,13,Fdescribed the incident as "racially
OL,14,Faggravated criminal damage".
OL,16,FThe Cornwall Islamic Community Centre
OL,17,Fnear Carnon Downs in Cornwall was
OL,18,Ftargeted on Thursday, with "substantial
OL,19,Fdamage" done to metal entrance gates,
OL,20,Fthought to have been caused by a
OL,21,Fvehicle, and a substance suspected to
OL,22,Fbe oil poured on the grounds and wall.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
