OL,3,GNEWSARacial vandalism posts show 'best
OL,4,Aand worst of society'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Scott Bradley, police commander
OL,7,Ffor Cornwall and the Isles of Scilly,
OL,8,Fsaid his reflection of the incident
OL,9,Fincluded the "various social media
OL,10,Fcommentary that followed".
